OL,3,GNEWSAWorld Cup dream win for cerebral
OL,4,Apalsy footballer
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreddie Lamb always dreamed of winning
OL,7,Fa World Cup.
OL,9,FOn Saturday, he saw that happen when
OL,10,Fthe England squad won the Cerebral
OL,11,FPalsy World Cup in the US.
OL,13,FThe Para Lions, as they are known, beat
OL,14,Fthe hosts the US 2-1 in extra time in
OL,15,FAtlanta to win the trophy for the first
OL,16,Ftime.
OL,18,FLamb, one of the squad's goalkeepers,
OL,19,Fwho lives in Derby, said: "It's been a
OL,20,Fwhirlwind last month, last couple of
OL,21,Fmonths, so all the training over the
OL,22,Flast 15 years made it work."
